## Original Content
Chanteuse et compositrice, Dolly Parton laisse derrière elle un répertoire immense. Voici dix chansons emblématiques pour redécouvrir l’une des plus grandes figures de la musique américaine.

## Summary
Dolly Parton, a legendary singer and songwriter, has passed away at the age of 80. The article celebrates her enduring legacy by highlighting ten of her most iconic songs in American country music.

## Key Points
- Dolly Parton was a major figure in American country music, known for her extensive songwriting and singing career.
- She died at the age of 80, leaving behind a rich repertoire of music.
- The article lists iconic songs such as 'Jolene', 'I Will Always Love You', and '9 to 5' to commemorate her work.
- Her contributions have made her one of the most influential artists in American music history.
- The piece aims to rediscover her through her emblematic songs, emphasizing her cultural impact.


